1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,220
(Priya:)There is no assigned seats,
Sheldon.

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:04,050
(Priya:)Just sit anywhere.
Make yourself comfortable.

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,490
(Sheldon:)Oh, what fun.

4
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:08,520
(Sheldon:)We're like hippies at a love-in.

5
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:10,830
(Leonard:)Just sit here.

6
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:13,400
(Sheldon:)Right on, man. Right on.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,900
(Sheldon:)Oh, look.

8
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:21,640
it's Harry Potter and 98%
of The Sorcerer's Stone.

9
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:24,840
(Raj:)Okay, we've
got fajitas

10
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:27,430
(Raj:)with all the fixins,
so you make your own.

11
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:28,680
(Sheldon:)Wonderful.

12
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,480
(Sheldon:)Dinner, some
assembly required.

13
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:34,100
(Priya:)Do you want a margarita,
Sheldon?

14
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,180
A margarita?!

15
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:37,820
Where are we?!
What is happening?!

16
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:41,520
(Penny:)Oh. Hey, Sheldon.

17
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,560
What can I get you?

18
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:44,790
(Sheldon:)Water. Neat.

19
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:46,980
(Sheldon:)With a little umbrella.

20
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,760
(Penny:)Where are all your friends?

21
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:52,150
(Sheldon:)Sadly, Penny, this evening,
I am the Dark Knight,

22
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:54,320
(Sheldon:)roaming these
mean streets alone.

23
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:56,640
(Sheldon:)A windbreaker for my cape,

24
00:00:56,640 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)and a stern expression
for my cowl.

